{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107360/extras/828b69218a68f21831333534c341434f.apng?t=1761238818\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107360/extras/828b69218a68f21831333534c341434f.poster.avif?t=1761238818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=483 height=63 /></picture></span><br><br>Grooveyard is a chill puzzle game brimming with humor and skeletons. Use your magical powers to manipulate walls and guide your skeletal minions to freedom. Enjoy a mix of strategy and rhythm as you uncover the secrets of your bodiless origins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107360/extras/5728bb3a50ccc55589b1733379d9ac1b.poster.avif?t=1761238818\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107360/extras/5728bb3a50ccc55589b1733379d9ac1b.webm?t=1761238818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107360/extras/5728bb3a50ccc55589b1733379d9ac1b.mp4?t=1761238818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Grooveyard features six unique worlds, each with its own aesthetic and challenges. Start in a traditional graveyard, master wall-jumping in a ruined cathedral, unlock doors in an underground prison, navigate broken tiles in a crystallized cave, and defy gravity in a hellish palace. Finally, test your skills in the ultimate world. Each puzzle offers multiple solutions, rewarding clever and efficient play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107360/extras/660fb0098c87fa5433e1ef74c513e8ca.apng?t=1761238818\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107360/extras/6